This information is incredibly helpful. Your core control plane—including all three kube-apiserver instances, controllers, and schedulers—is successfully Running and stable. Your local kubectl context can also query all Calico CRDs and api-resources seamlessly.
However, as we can see from your pod status, every single calico-node pod across your entire cluster is now trapped in a CrashLoopBackOff:

calico-node-4w7dj                       0/1     CrashLoopBackOff   15 (4m10s ago)   178m
